1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:04,500
A pale sun shines over a frozen valley between jagged, snow-covered mountains. Giant, glowing cyan crystals jut from the icy slopes.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:08,500
A colony ship streaks across the bright sky. Below, silhouettes of large, long-tailed beasts stand motionless in the freezing fog.

3
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,000
Winds whip loose snow across the desolate ice.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,693
Everything fades to black.
